<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber cuts two on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber cuts two on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Gary Gordon downgraded HomeSide Inc and North American Mortgage Corp to attractive from buy.</p>
<p>-- both were downgraded due to the prices of their stocks, PaineWebber said.</p>
<p>-- HomeSide fell 5/8 to 20-1/8.</p>
<p>-- North American Mortgage slipped 3/8 to 23-1/2.</p>
</text>
